cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this supplementary matrix, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-Tradition Coding Matrix: Nineteen Traditions against Seven Capacities"
abstract: "Supplementary data for The Irreducible Human (Smárason & Guttesen): the record behind the book's cross-civilisational convergence claim. Nineteen traditions (eighteen civilisational, one modern check-row) coded against seven capacity categories, with recurrence and independence tallies and a table of excluded candidate capacities."
type: dataset
